      "settings": {
        "pf_55e2ce1a_value": "<b>Terms of Service (TOS) - #PROTEINVIBES TikTok Contest<br><br>1.&nbsp;Eligibility:&nbsp;</b>The <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">#PROTEINVIBES</span> TikTok Contest (\"Contest\") is open to legal North American residents (Canada, United States, Mexico) who are 18 years of age or older at the time of entry. Employees of Canadian Protein and their immediate family members are not eligible to participate.<br><b>2.&nbsp;Contest Period:</b> The Contest begins on [start date] at 12:00 AM [time zone] and ends on [end date] at 11:59 PM [time zone]. All entries must be received within this period to be considered.<br><b>3.&nbsp;Entry Guidelines:</b> a. Participants must create a captivating TikTok video within a maximum duration of 1 minute. b. The video must prominently feature a Canadian Protein product, which can include Protein Powders, Supplements, Gym Equipment, or Apparel. c. Use the hashtag <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">#PROTEINVIBES</span> and tag Canadian Protein (@canadianprotein) in your video to ensure we can find your entry. Please make sure your video is set to public visibility. d. By participating in the Contest, participants grant Canadian Protein the right to use their TikTok video for promotional purposes.<br><b>4.&nbsp;Winner Selection:</b> a. There will be a total of 3 winners selected by a panel of judges appointed by Canadian Protein. The judging criteria will be based on creativity, adherence to the entry guidelines, and overall impact of the video. b. The 1st place winner will receive a $1,000 Canadian Protein gift card. c. The 2nd place winner will receive [prize description]. d. The 3rd place winner will receive [prize description]. e. The winners will be announced on [announcement date] on Canadian Protein's social media platforms and contacted via their TikTok account. If the winner does not respond within 48 hours, an alternate winner will be chosen.\n<br><b>5. Prize Details:</b> a. Prizes are non-transferable and cannot be exchanged for cash.<br><b>6.&nbsp;General Conditions:</b> a. Canadian Protein reserves the right to disqualify any entry that violates the entry guidelines or terms. b. By participating in the Contest, entrants agree to abide by these terms and the decisions of Canadian Protein, which are final and binding. c. Canadian Protein reserves the right to cancel or modify the Contest if fraud, technical failures, or any other factor beyond its control impairs the integrity of the Contest.<br><b>7.&nbsp;Privacy:</b> a. Personal information collected during the Contest will be used in accordance with Canadian Protein's privacy policy.<br><b>8.&nbsp;Governing Law:</b> a. The Contest is governed by the laws of Canada without regard to conflicts of law principles.\n<br><b>9.&nbsp;Sponsor:</b> a. The Contest is sponsored by Canadian Protein, [2835 Kew Dr Unit #6, Windsor, ON N8T 3B7].<br><br>By participating in the <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">#PROTEINVIBES</span> TikTok Contest, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to abide by these Terms of Service. Good luck!",
        "pf_bd70fc8e_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 186, 219);\"></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 186, 219);\"></span></b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 186, 219);\"></span>2nd Place<b> - </b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 186, 219);\">$100</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"></span>",
        "pf_9224028b_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Above all, enjoy the process and let your creativity soar! Remember, the most imaginative entry will emerge victorious. So, have a blast and infuse your video with your unique artistic flair. Let your creativity shine bright, and may the most innovative&nbsp;creation claim the ultimate prize!</span>",
        "pf_05b9dd36_value": "The Canadian Protein team will carefully review and evaluate ALL submissions that are public that have Canadian Protein tagged and are hashtagged with <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">#PROTEINVIBES</span></b>&nbsp;to determine the winners of the contest. Every entry will be considered in the selection process.",
        "pf_0882999b_value": "The video contest will conclude on <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">September 30th, 2023, at 11:59 PM EST</span></b>. Please note that any videos uploaded to TikTok after this deadline will not be considered for participation or evaluation. Make sure to submit your entries before the specified cutoff time.",
        "pf_87c85d9c_value": "You are free to use <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">ANY</span></b> Canadian Protein product for your video entry. Whether it's a protein powder, supplement, or any other product from our range, feel free to showcase your creativity using any Canadian Protein product of your choice.",
        "pf_4dc34005_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ensure that your video is captivating within a concise timeframe, with a <b>maximum duration of 1 minute</b>. There are no restrictions on the minimum length, allowing you the freedom to express your creativity without limitations.</span>",
        "pf_bb265b0d_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Entries will be automatically collected (every 24 hours) from TikTok with the hashtag<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"> <b>#PROTEINVIBES</b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\"><b><br></b></span></span>",
        "pf_e4b251b2_value": "There is <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">no specific theme</span></b> for the video contest. However, keep in mind that the most creative entry will be the winner. So let your imagination run wild and showcase your unique ideas!",
        "pf_6a797426_value": "There is <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">no limit</span></b> to the number of entries you can submit. Feel free to enter the contest as many times as you'd like, increasing your chances of winning. Good luck!",
        "pf_0b6d9224_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">When uploading the video to TikTok, make sure to you use the hashtag <b>#PROTEINVIBES</b>&nbsp;and tag us so we can find your video. (Make sure your video is public)</span>",
        "pf_d2a16665_value": "Contest open to North American residents (<b><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">Canada, United States, Mexico</span></span></b>) age <b><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">18+</span></span></b>.",
        "pf_69c25f8c_value": "Videos should adhere to a <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">maximum duration of 1 minute</span></b>. Any content exceeding the 1-minute mark will not be considered for evaluation or inclusion.",
        "pf_7ce3c149_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">View Entries</span></span></span>",
        "pf_9a8468f6_value": "<span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\"></span><span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VIDEO CONTEST</span></b>",
        "pf_74de0b6d_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Your video must feature a Canadian Protein product. It can be anything from <b>Protein Powders, Supplements, Gym Equipment and Apparel.</b></span>",
